    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60395" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτοίν-α</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτοῖνα</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτίζω</span>) Rhod. name for <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a local division</i>, like
			
				Att.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆμος</span>, <i>township,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(1).694
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1033
			</span></i>, al.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτύναι ἢ κτοῖναι:
				χωρήσεις προγονικῶν ἱερείων, ἢ δῆμος
			μεμερισμένος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτοίνα</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				10.261
			</span></i>).</div>
